.DS_Store
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/sdks
!.yarn/versions
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
.build/

dsh-plugin-desktop/dist/
dsh-plugin-desktop/lib/
dsh-community-market/lib/
canvas-studio/lib/

# 字体子集构建的源字体缓存（10MB/字重；产物 assets/fonts/*.woff2 已入库，缓存不入库）
canvas-studio/.cache/

# 测试/沙箱临时产物（TMPDIR 指向工作区跑全量测试时留下；不是产品产物）
canvas-studio/.tmp-smoke/
canvas-studio/codebuddy-toybox.*

# Bundled ffmpeg prebuilts (fetched per packaging run; ~119MB for macOS universal)
dsh-plugin-desktop/build/ffmpeg/

.env.yarn
# Local tooling / third-party reference material (not part of the MIT product)
.workbuddy/
reference/

# Local E2E harness (driver + shots; not part of the product build)
e2e/

# 本地一次性目录（截图工具 / 分享包缓存；当前为空，避免误入库）
.screenshots/
.trae-html-share-packages/

# 一次性会话诊断报告（生成于仓库根；已移 docs/evidence/ 的不再生成新名）
/session-*-report.html
